
// Dark Skies DLC

UI.Notifications.NewCampaign.Summary.BrokenEarth=Humanity has been given a second chance. 
UI.Notifications.NewCampaign.Headline.BrokenEarth=A Second Chance
UI.Notifications.NewCampaign.Detail.BrokenEarth=One hundred and fifty years have passed since an ordinary man was thrust into history, forced to make a decision of immeasurable consequence. A great winter followed his choice. Many lives were lost, and many stories forgotten. Humanity has since regained its footing, pushing far beyond the heights of the prewar era, yet old wounds still bleed. Mankind once more looks to the stars, unaware that the stars are looking back.
